abstract: >-
  Zero-Mathlib Lean 4.35.0 six-kernel formalization (14 headline theorems,
  15 Palomar Comparator targets, 31 explicit #print axioms checks and an
  exhaustive 471-declaration AuditAllDecls.lean metaprogramming sweep with
  0 violations strictly within propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound) and
  nine-language polyglot/quantum verification stack (Lean 4.35.0, Rust, Zig 0.17,
  ISO C11, bare-metal x86-64 NASM assembly, ISO C++20, Eshkol v1.3.6 LLVM AD,
  Moonlab WASM, QGTL C, and Python) resolving a connected chain of four open
  problems across three 2026 preprints (arXiv:2512.19657v2, arXiv:2607.07197,
  arXiv:2610.02392): (1) Exact refutation of Erew-Goldstein Conjecture 1 via
  Pythagorean qutrit WH-SIC fiducials (v345, |Stab|=3, dim=2 across all 216
  provably distinct elements of PCliff_3) and a universal all-d Zauner
  eigenspace dimension obstruction; (2) Proof of Erew-Goldstein Conjecture 2
  across the entire high-mana regime Mana(psi) > (1/2) ln(D/2) via the
  Trace-Norm Spectral Lock plus the exact Cubic-Mod-3 Wigner origin dichotomy;
  (3) Universal all-prime d>=5, all-n finite-field Alltop attainment
  M_2 = ln[q^2/(2q-1)], 1D parabolic Clifford unification, exact Gaussian-integer
  Super-MUB ruptures at composite d=4 and 3-qubit Hoggar, and exact Z[zeta_5]
  certification of the 1-qudit d=5 Alltop saddle instability; and (4) Complete
  all-d>=2 proof of Kulhandjian-Hanzo Conjecture 24 and d_min(Q(2,d))=2,
  universal odd-prime upper bound d_min(Q(p,2)) <= p+1 with internal circulant
  commutation proof, and exact settlement d_min(Q(7,2)) = 8 via Lean-verified
  weight-8 witness and independent Rust and C11+NASM exhaustive 1,546,218-orbit
  certifications.
